    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ord</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">and sprænge se mæssepreost haligwæter ofer hig ealle, and heora ælc abyrige þæs halig-wæteres, and sylle heom eallum cyssan bóc and Cristes rode tacn;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">and the mass-priest shall sprinkle holy water over them all, and each of them shall taste the holy water. And [the mass-priest] shall give them all the book and the symbol of Christ's cross to kiss.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 sprænge se mæssepreost haligwæter ofer hig ealle – 7 heora ælc abyrige þæs haligwæteres – 7 sylle heom eallum cyssan bóc 7 Cristes rode tacn.</ab>
      </div>
